# /settings' Collapse tool calls switched on while the turn's group is still
# open: its call row goes and what is written next -- the switch's own notice
# -- lands under the group's blank row. In ask mode, so the command is
# decided by key (as `settings-collapse.cap`).
# fx's harness launches it with FX_SOUND=0; xfx is given the same start.
xfx: env XFX_SOUND=off
fx: gateway settings-collapse-fx.json
xfx: gateway settings-collapse-xfx.json
work toolgroup-ws
fx: seed toolgroup-ask-settings.json
fx: env FX_PERMISSION_MODE=ask
xfx: env XFX_PERMISSION_MODE=ask
wait 2
type look
key Enter
wait 3
type again
key Enter
wait 3
type run it
key Enter
wait 2.5
key 1
wait 0.8
snap running
type /settings
key Enter
wait 1
key Down Down Down Down
wait 0.3
key Right
wait 0.8
snap collapse-on
key Escape
wait 0.5
snap after-esc
